80 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (I am a designer who grew up between two cultures, understanding the intersection of different values. I have a creative family back in my home country, and I carry with me a deep appreciation for the care and intention behind every artifact they made. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Now living in Vancouver, where emerging technology, including AI, is all around, I have figured out this: good design is not just about how something looks with high-end software. It is about who it serves, who made it, and whether it is honest and true about who you are.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
